sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(254,205,211) People
    actor T as Teacher
  end
  box rgb(254,215,170) Moodle
    participant Core as Moodle core events, cron, files
  end
  box rgb(253,240,138) Moodle plugin local_llmchat
    participant Obs as Observer and outbox
    participant Sync as Sync incremental, full_sync, collector
  end
  box rgb(187,247,208) Python server moodle_llm_chat
    participant API as API ingest routes
    participant Pipe as Pipeline workers
    participant DB as Encrypted store
  end
  box rgb(221,214,254) LLM provider
    participant Mod as Embedding and vision models
  end
  box rgb(203,213,225) Other external services
    participant Ext as YouTube, HackMD, Google Docs, Nextcloud, TaskCards
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over T,Pipe: PATH A - Incremental sync, triggered by an edit
    T->>Core: edits an activity or uploads a file
    Core->>Obs: course_module_updated event
    Obs->>Obs: enqueue one outbox row per module, a newer change replaces it
    Core->>Obs: cron runs drain_outbox_task
    Obs->>Sync: process the due row
    Sync->>Core: read the module and its files
    Core-->>Sync: content and file hashes
    Sync->>API: POST documents
    API->>DB: upsert documents
    API-->>Sync: changed ids and the blobs it still needs
    loop each file the server lacks
      Sync->>API: PUT blob by sha256
      API->>DB: store the encrypted blob
    end
    API->>Pipe: documents_changed and blob_arrived
    alt push succeeded
      Sync->>Obs: delete the outbox row
    else push failed
      Sync->>Obs: attempts plus one and back off, retry later
    end
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over Core,DB: PATH B - Full sync, scheduled or started by the admin
    Core->>Sync: full_sync starts or resumes an open run
    Sync->>API: POST sync start and POST courses
    loop each course, progress saved after every course
      Sync->>Core: collect the course
      Core-->>Sync: documents and hashes
      Sync->>API: POST manifest with hashes only
      API->>DB: apply_manifest marks documents as seen
      API-->>Sync: ids of documents it needs
      Sync->>API: POST only the needed documents and PUT missing blobs
      API->>Pipe: documents_changed with bulk priority
    end
    Sync->>API: POST sync finish
    API->>DB: tombstone documents and courses missing from every manifest
    API-->>Sync: result with the tombstoned ids
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over Pipe,Mod: PATH C - Processing inside the Python server
    Pipe->>DB: claim due jobs for fetch, extract and ocr
    alt inline text or HTML
      Pipe->>Pipe: convert to text
    else uploaded file
      Pipe->>DB: read and decrypt the blob
      Pipe->>Pipe: extract text by file type in a worker thread
      Note over Pipe,DB: if the blob has not arrived the job waits until it does
    else external link
      Pipe->>Ext: fetch with per-host rate limit and retries
      Ext-->>Pipe: transcript, page or document text
    end
    Pipe->>Pipe: chunk to about 1200 characters with a breadcrumb prefix
    Pipe->>DB: store encrypted segments and chunks and update the keyword index
    opt page is scanned or an image
      Pipe->>Mod: OCR the page image, cached by image hash
      Mod-->>Pipe: recognised text
      Pipe->>DB: replace the content
    end
    Pipe->>DB: collect chunks without vectors across all documents
    Pipe->>Mod: embed one batch, provider is called only on a cache miss
    Mod-->>Pipe: vectors
    Pipe->>DB: store vectors, document is searchable
  end
